From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:44:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/19] kcm: Put the View menu's last items in the menu

The separator and Show Screen Contents were written inside the Fit All item, so the
menu held three items instead of five. Close Fit All before them.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
---
 kcm/ui/main.qml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kcm/ui/main.qml b/kcm/ui/main.qml
index f55f5ed1..fdaf0fea 100644
--- a/kcm/ui/main.qml
+++ b/kcm/ui/main.qml
@@ -451,6 +451,7 @@ KCM.AbstractKCM {
                             enabled: screen.zoomed
                             onTriggered: screen.fitAll()
                         }
+                    }
                     QQC2.MenuSeparator {}
                     QQC2.MenuItem {
                         action: QQC2.Action {
@@ -461,7 +462,6 @@ KCM.AbstractKCM {
                             onTriggered: kcm.screenContents.shown = checked
                         }
                     }
-                    }
                 }
             }
 
